5. [Rate Engine — Pseudocode](#5-rate-engine--pseudocode)
6. [BOQ Generation — Pseudocode](#6-boq-generation--pseudocode)
7. [3D Model Generation — Integration Plan](#7-3d-model-generation--integration-plan)
8. [Implementation Roadmap](#8-implementation-roadmap)

