## 3. New / Modified API Endpoints

### 3.1 Overview

| Method | Endpoint | Action | Status |
|---|---|---|---|
| `POST` | `/api/upload-plan` | Upload image → ML detect → return detections | **MODIFY** |
| `POST` | `/api/detections/confirm` | User confirms/edits detections | **NEW** |
| `GET` | `/api/rates` | List rates (with section/material filters) | **NEW** |
| `GET` | `/api/rates/:id` | Get single rate | **NEW** |
| `POST` | `/api/rates` | Create single rate (admin) | **NEW** |
| `PUT` | `/api/rates/:id` | Update a rate (admin) | **NEW** |
| `POST` | `/api/rates/upload-csv` | Bulk import rates from CSV | **NEW** |
| `GET` | `/api/rates/sections` | List all sections with available materials | **NEW** |
| `POST` | `/api/boq/generate` | Generate BOQ from confirmed detections + rates | **NEW** |
| `POST` | `/api/generate-3d-geometry` | Generate 3D geometry (existing, no change) | KEEP |

### 3.2 Modified: `POST /api/upload-plan`

**Change in** [uploadController.js](file:///c:/Users/Ridma%20Chalana/Desktop/green-build/backend/controllers/uploadController.js):

Currently (line 121-153): calculates costs and includes them in response.
**New behaviour:** Return raw ML detections only; do NOT calculate costs.

```javascript
// BEFORE (line 121-153):
const costs = calculateCosts(quantities);
const response = { data: { quantities, costs, ... } };

// AFTER:
const response = {
    success: true,
    message: 'Floor plan analyzed. Please review detections.',
    data: {
        // Raw ML detections for user review
        detections: {
            walls: {
                totalLengthM: quantities.wall_total_length_m,
                grossAreaM2: quantities.wall_gross_surface_area_m2,
                netAreaM2: quantities.wall_net_surface_area_m2,
                deductionsM2: quantities.deductions_area_m2,
            },
            doors: quantities.item_counts?.doors || 0,
            windows: quantities.item_counts?.windows || 0,
            rooms: quantities.room_detection || null,
            warning: quantities.warning || null
        },
        // Visualizations for overlay editing
        overlays: {
            detectionOverlay: quantities.detection_overlay_base64 || null,
            roomMap: quantities.room_detection?.room_map_base64 || null
        },
        inputParameters: {
            scalePpm: scale,
            wallHeightM: wallHeight,
            originalFilename: req.file.originalname,
            fileSizeKb: parseFloat(fileSizeKb)
        }
    }
};
```

> [!NOTE]
> The old `costs` field is removed from the upload response. Costs are now computed in the `POST /api/boq/generate` endpoint after user confirmation.

