## 4. Updated Data Flow

### Current Flow (Single-pass)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant F as Frontend
    participant B as Backend
    participant ML as ML Service

    U->>F: Upload image + scale + height
    F->>B: POST /api/upload-plan
    B->>ML: POST /calculate-quantities
    ML-->>B: quantities + overlays
    B->>B: calculateCosts(quantities) ← hardcoded rates
    B-->>F: { quantities, costs, overlays }
    F->>F: Generate BOQ table locally
    F-->>U: Display BOQ + images

    Note right of F: 3D generated separately
    F->>B: POST /generate-3d-geometry
    B->>ML: POST /generate-3d-geometry
    ML-->>B: geometry JSON
    B-->>F: { walls, doors, windows }
    F-->>U: Three.js 3D view
```

### New Flow (Multi-step with confirmation)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant F as Frontend
    participant B as Backend
    participant ML as ML Service
    participant DB as MongoDB

    rect rgb(30, 60, 80)
    Note over U,ML: STEP 1 — Upload & Detect
    U->>F: Upload floor plan
    F->>B: POST /api/upload-plan
    B->>ML: POST /calculate-quantities
    ML-->>B: detections + overlays
    B-->>F: { detections, overlays } ← NO costs
    end

    rect rgb(60, 50, 80)
    Note over U,F: STEP 2 — Review & Edit Detections
    F-->>U: Show detection overlays (editable)
    U->>F: Approve/edit/delete items
    U->>F: Set material types per room
    F->>B: POST /api/detections/confirm
    B->>DB: Save confirmedDetections
    B-->>F: Confirmation receipt
    end

    rect rgb(40, 70, 60)
    Note over U,DB: STEP 3 — Material & Rate Selection
    F->>B: GET /api/rates?section=...
    B->>DB: Query rates (effectiveDate ≤ today)
    B-->>F: Available rates per section
    U->>F: Select materials + review rates
    end

    rect rgb(80, 50, 30)
    Note over U,ML: STEP 4 — Generate BOQ + 3D
    F->>B: POST /api/boq/generate
    B->>DB: Read confirmedDetections
    B->>DB: Lookup rates via Rate Engine
    B->>B: BOQ Generator builds sections A–F
    B->>DB: Save BOQReport
    B-->>F: Full BOQ with sections & summary

    F->>B: POST /api/generate-3d-geometry
    B->>ML: POST /generate-3d-geometry
    ML-->>B: 3D geometry
    B-->>F: Three.js-ready JSON
    F-->>U: BOQ tables + 3D model
    end
```

