## 7. 3D Model Generation — Integration Plan

### Current State

The 3D pipeline is already functional:

| Component | File | Status |
|---|---|---|
| ML endpoint | `/generate-3d-geometry` on ML service | ✅ Working |
| Backend proxy | [uploadController.js:188-267](file:///c:/Users/Ridma%20Chalana/Desktop/green-build/backend/controllers/uploadController.js#L188-L267) | ✅ Working |
| Frontend viewer | [FloorPlan3DViewer.jsx](file:///c:/Users/Ridma%20Chalana/Desktop/green-build/frontend/src/views/components/FloorPlan3DViewer.jsx) | ✅ Working (Three.js) |
| Frontend service | [apiService.js:74-90](file:///c:/Users/Ridma%20Chalana/Desktop/green-build/frontend/src/services/apiService.js#L74-L90) | ✅ Working |

### Required Changes

> [!TIP]
> The 3D system is already modular. The only change needed is **when** it's triggered (after BOQ confirmation instead of during upload).

#### Change 1: Trigger 3D Generation After BOQ Confirmation

Current (in [QuantityTakeoff/index.jsx](file:///c:/Users/Ridma%20Chalana/Desktop/green-build/frontend/src/views/modules/QuantityTakeoff/index.jsx)):
- ✅ Already moved to Step 4 in the wizard (from our last session)
- 3D is generated after user clicks "Generate BOQ & 3D"

**No backend change needed** — the `/api/generate-3d-geometry` endpoint already works independently.

#### Change 2: Pass Confirmed Detections to 3D Generator (Enhancement)

Currently the ML service re-processes the image for 3D. Optionally, we can pass confirmed detections to avoid double processing:

```javascript
// NEW optional endpoint (ML Service):
// POST /generate-3d-geometry-from-detections
// Body: { confirmed_walls, confirmed_doors, confirmed_windows, wall_height }
// Returns: geometry JSON without re-running ML detection
```

This is an **optional optimization** — not required for MVP.

#### Change 3: Enhanced 3D Features from Confirmed Data

The existing [FloorPlan3DViewer.jsx](file:///c:/Users/Ridma%20Chalana/Desktop/green-build/frontend/src/views/components/FloorPlan3DViewer.jsx) already renders:
- ✅ Room floors (colored polygons)
- ✅ Window panes (translucent blue)
- ✅ Door panels (brown)
- ✅ Grid helper
- ✅ Orbit controls

**Enhancement plan** (post-MVP):

| Feature | How | Priority |
|---|---|---|
| Floor slab | Add a thin gray slab at y=0 under all rooms | High |
| Wall extrusion | Already in [createWallEdges()](file:///c:/Users/Ridma%20Chalana/Desktop/green-build/frontend/src/views/components/FloorPlan3DViewer.jsx#289-329) (line 290) — enable it | High |
| Material colors | Color rooms by flooring material (tile=beige, wood=brown) | Medium |
| Labels | Add 3D text labels for room types | Low |

### 3D Integration Flow (Post-Refactoring)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant F as Frontend (Step 4)
    participant B as Backend
    participant ML as ML Service

    U->>F: Click "Generate BOQ & 3D"
    
    par BOQ Generation
        F->>B: POST /api/boq/generate
        B-->>F: BOQ sections + summary
    and 3D Generation
        F->>B: POST /api/generate-3d-geometry
        B->>ML: Forward image + params
        ML-->>B: geometry JSON
        B-->>F: walls/doors/windows polygons
    end
    
    F->>F: Render Three.js scene
    F->>F: Display BOQ tables
    F-->>U: Complete view
```

