## 8. Implementation Roadmap

### Phase Sequencing

```mermaid
gantt
    title Implementation Phases
    dateFormat  YYYY-MM-DD
    axisFormat  %d %b

    section Phase 1 - DB
    Rate model + seed data       :p1a, 2026-03-04, 1d
    BOQReport schema update      :p1b, after p1a, 1d
    FloorPlan schema update      :p1c, after p1a, 1d

    section Phase 2 - Rate Engine
    rateEngine service           :p2a, after p1c, 1d
    Rate CRUD controller/routes  :p2b, after p2a, 1d
    CSV import endpoint          :p2c, after p2b, 1d
    Seed default rates           :p2d, after p2c, 1d

    section Phase 3 - Backend APIs
    Modify upload response       :p3a, after p2d, 1d
