```

### Priority Order

| # | Phase | What | Effort | Risk |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | **Rate model + seeding** | Create `models/Rate.js`, seed script, modify BOQReport/FloorPlan schemas | 1 day | Low |
| 2 | **Rate Engine service** | Create `services/rateEngine.js` with DB lookup + fallback logic | 1 day | Low |
| 3 | **Rate API + admin CSV** | `rateController.js`, `rateRoutes.js`, CSV parser | 1 day | Low |
| 4 | **Modify upload response** | Strip costs from [processFloorPlan()](file:///c:/Users/Ridma%20Chalana/Desktop/green-build/backend/controllers/uploadController.js#6-180), return detections only | 0.5 day | Medium — breaking change |
| 5 | **Detection confirmation API** | New endpoint to save confirmed detections | 0.5 day | Low |
| 6 | **BOQ Generator service** | `services/boqGenerator.js` — 6-section builder using Rate Engine | 2 days | Medium |
| 7 | **BOQ generate endpoint** | Wire up controller + route for `/api/boq/generate` | 0.5 day | Low |
| 8 | **Frontend: apiService** | Add `confirmDetections()`, `fetchRates()`, [generateBOQ()](file:///c:/Users/Ridma%20Chalana/Desktop/green-build/frontend/src/models/boqModel.js#400-423) | 0.5 day | Low |
| 9 | **Frontend: Detection edit** | Editable overlays in [DetectionReviewPanel.jsx](file:///c:/Users/Ridma%20Chalana/Desktop/green-build/frontend/src/views/modules/QuantityTakeoff/DetectionReviewPanel.jsx) | 2 days | Medium |
| 10 | **Frontend: Material + rate UI** | Material selectors + rate preview in [ManualInputStep.jsx](file:///c:/Users/Ridma%20Chalana/Desktop/green-build/frontend/src/views/modules/QuantityTakeoff/ManualInputStep.jsx) | 1 day | Low |
| 11 | **Frontend: BOQ from backend** | [BOQResultView.jsx](file:///c:/Users/Ridma%20Chalana/Desktop/green-build/frontend/src/views/modules/QuantityTakeoff/BOQResultView.jsx) consumes backend BOQ instead of local computation | 1 day | Low |
| 12 | **3D polish + testing** | Floor slab, wall extrusions, E2E testing | 2 days | Low |

> [!WARNING]
> **Phase 4 (modify upload response)** is a breaking change for the existing quick-analysis flow. Ensure the frontend wizard is updated simultaneously, or use feature flags to support both responses during transition.

### Backward Compatibility Strategy

