| `POST /api/upload-plan` | Returns detections (new shape). Old clients that expect `costs` will break — but the only client is our own frontend |
| [costModel.js](file:///c:/Users/Ridma%20Chalana/Desktop/green-build/backend/models/costModel.js) | Keep file — it's used by [floorPlanController.js](file:///c:/Users/Ridma%20Chalana/Desktop/green-build/backend/controllers/floorPlanController.js) for project-scoped uploads. Deprecate but don't delete |
