| Old [generateBOQData()](file:///c:/Users/Ridma%20Chalana/Desktop/green-build/frontend/src/models/boqModel.js#400-423) in boqModel.js | Keep as legacy export — [BOQResultView.jsx](file:///c:/Users/Ridma%20Chalana/Desktop/green-build/frontend/src/views/modules/QuantityTakeoff/BOQResultView.jsx) will switch to backend-generated BOQ |
